{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08920","headline":"月夜金陵怀古 · 李白","name":"月夜金陵怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍苍金陵月，空悬帝王州。\n天文列宿在，霸业大江流。\n绿水绝驰道，青松摧古丘。\n台倾鳷鹊观，宫没凤凰楼。\n别殿悲清暑，芳园罢乐游。\n一闻歌玉树，萧瑟後庭秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}